[SIZE=6][B]🔊 Halloween Plugin v1.6.2 - Sound Command[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]What's New:[/B][/SIZE]

[B]🎵 Horror Sound Command[/B]
Play spooky sounds to specific players or everyone!

[CODE]
/halloween sound <player|@a> <sound>

Examples:
/halloween sound Steve cave_ambience
/halloween sound @a witch_cackle
/scary sound PlayerName enderman_scream
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B]Available Sounds:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]cave_ambience[/FONT] - Eerie cave sounds
[*][FONT=Courier New]witch_cackle[/FONT] - Witch laughing
[*][FONT=Courier New]ghast_scream[/FONT] - Ghast crying
[*][FONT=Courier New]enderman_scream[/FONT] - Enderman scream
[*][FONT=Courier New]zombie_growl[/FONT] - Zombie groaning
[*][FONT=Courier New]skeleton_rattle[/FONT] - Skeleton rattling
[*][FONT=Courier New]creeper_hiss[/FONT] - Creeper fuse
[*][FONT=Courier New]wither[/FONT] - Wither ambient
[*][FONT=Courier New]ender_dragon[/FONT] - Dragon growl
[*][FONT=Courier New]thunder[/FONT] - Thunder strike
[*][FONT=Courier New]bell[/FONT] - Bell toll
[*][FONT=Courier New]portal[/FONT] - Nether portal
[*][FONT=Courier New]soul[/FONT] - Soul escape
[*][FONT=Courier New]sculk_shriek[/FONT] - Sculk shrieker
[*][FONT=Courier New]warden_heartbeat[/FONT] - Warden heartbeat
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Features:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]✅ Tab completion for players and sounds
[*]✅ Broadcast to all with [FONT=Courier New]@a[/FONT]
[*]✅ Works with custom command prefix
[*]✅ Confirmation messages
[*]✅ 15 unique horror sounds
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][I]Compatible with Minecraft 1.20+ | Requires [FONT=Courier New]halloween.use[/FONT] permission[/I][/SIZE]
